docket 0.2.0b5 (scratch venv install of rack-cli branch harness-contract-1.2 @ 67665c58, which contains 4aa51b4e "harness contract 1.2")

Real `docket exec --contract 1.2 --workspace <dir> --task-file <file> --agent-id
capture-attempt-1 --timeout 30 --token-file <file>` transcript, with no --model, DOCKET_HOME in
a scratch directory and DOCKET_SETUP_HOME a scratch setup home like setup-harness-ready.json's
whose `local` provider points at a throwaway loopback HTTP server standing in for the model
endpoint. The server answered one `write` tool call, then a final assistant message, naming
the model `served/observed-model-x`. The result's `model` is
`{"requested": "local/local-model", "served": "served/observed-model-x", "source": "setup default"}`.
The scratch directory is rewritten to `/capture` and nothing else changed.
